@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Totals per category (Bills has no expenses: does it show up?)
GET {{host}}/expenses/by-category

### 2. Add Movie night (category 4 = Fun)
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Movie night",
  "amount": 18,
  "categoryId": 4
}

### 3. Totals again
GET {{host}}/expenses/by-category
